    "created_at": "2016-04-14T07:30:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-14T07:30:32Z",
    "body": "I guess we could remove the \"domintro\" box, mark it \"// historical\" in IDL, and add \"This API fell out of fashion as it globally exposes script and SVG script element. The JavaScript community is looking for a way to identify these without making them globally available.\" as a note underneath the normative definition.\n",
